Yagyuu?

00:19:16.810 --> 00:19:20.980
Y-Y-Y-Yagyuu is the household of the shogun's swordmasters!

00:19:20.980 --> 00:19:24.400
With that type of status, you're going to resist the student council?!

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:26.110
What a naive man.

00:19:26.110 --> 00:19:29.740
Don't say that too much, since it's just what I was thinking, too.

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:33.990
If we get captured, there's no knowing what they might do to you.

00:19:33.990 --> 00:19:35.870
I hope you've prepared yourself.

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:37.910
Yeah, I just did.

00:19:37.910 --> 00:19:40.870
Matabei, think of this as your grave.

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:43.080
Yes, Yukimura-sama.

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:45.630
Th-Th-Th-This is insanity!

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:47.000
Yagyuu-dono has gone insane!

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:49.550
No matter. Please arrest them!

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:54.180
Again?

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:57.010
It's a flash round. Everyone, be careful!

00:19:57.640 --> 00:19:58.720
This is...?

00:19:58.720 --> 00:20:00.810
Wasn't it your doing?

00:20:00.810 --> 00:20:01.440
No...

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:03.400
Ah well, this is our chance.

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:04.310
Run!

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:06.060
Hey! Please wait!

00:20:06.060 --> 00:20:08.480
Huh? It's not bright...

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:12.700
What idiots... They mistook a firework for a flash round!

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:14.110
No...

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:15.620
It's not a firework...

00:20:15.990 --> 00:20:17.530
What is that light...?

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:20.330
Yukimura-sama!

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:22.710
What is he doing?

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:33.550
What did he do this time-

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:34.680
What is that?!

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:54.950
A-A girl?

00:20:58.580 --> 00:21:00.990
Wh-Who in the world are you...?

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:03.910
O-Onii-chan...

00:21:28.770 --> 00:21:30.150
Who are you...?

00:21:31.230 --> 00:21:32.110
My name is...

00:21:32.940 --> 00:21:34.320
Yagyuu Jyuubei.

00:21:35.200 --> 00:21:36.320
Episode One

00:21:37.820 --> 00:21:41.030
The First
Kiss

00:23:11.580 --> 00:23:11.750
Next Time

00:23:11.750 --> 00:23:16.170
Hey, Muneakira. I heard that the first kiss tastes like lemon. Is that true?

00:23:16.170 --> 00:23:17.710
Eh?! What's gotten into you?

00:23:17.710 --> 00:23:19.800
This is an <i>extremely</i> important question.

00:23:20.050 --> 00:23:21.220
So, how was it?

00:23:21.220 --> 00:23:22.640
I can't really say...

00:23:22.640 --> 00:23:26.220
What?! So it wasn't your first kiss?!

00:23:26.220 --> 00:23:26.640
What the-

00:23:26.640 --> 00:23:30.690
I'd heard that sexual frivolity had been spreading among youngsters in Ooedo, but wow!

00:23:31.190 --> 00:23:33.360
You're dirty, indecent, an enemy of all women!

00:23:33.360 --> 00:23:35.860
No! It was my first kiss!

00:23:35.860 --> 00:23:37.400
Next time on Hyakka Ryouran:

00:23:37.400 --> 00:23:39.360
It'll be "Naked Reincarnation", Onii-chan!

00:23:39.360 --> 00:23:41.030
So, who are you?
